&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stratolaunch is a technology accelerator that engineers operationally realistic testing at Mach 5+. Our air-launched, Talon testbeds are reusable, cost-effective platforms that enable routine access to the hypersonic environment. We deliver flight data critical to validating system performance and achieving rapid technology deployment. Together with our customers, we drive innovations that are imperative to advancing national security.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; margin-left: .375in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;We are seeking a dedicated &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Application Analyst - Costpoint Experience &lt;/span&gt;to manage, configure, implement, and support our suite of enterprise, business-critical applications. This role balance hands-on technical administration with business process optimization across our flight operations, business, engineering and production teams. As the primary point of contact, the ideal candidate will handle application configurations, user access, and ongoing support, while leading or supporting new system implementations, system re-implementations, and process migrations. You will be responsible for defining technical requirements, optimizing business processes, and ensuring data governance to align our digital tools with strategic business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; margin-left: .375in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; margin-left: .375in; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;ESSENTIAL RESPONSIBILITIES &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top: 0in; margin-bottom: 0in;&quot; type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;System Administration &amp;amp; Configuration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;: Manage user accounts, access permissions, security profiles, license compliance, setting and managing system configurations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;Implementations &amp;amp; Change Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;: Lead or support the rollout of new software applications and the major re-implementation or restructuring of existing systems to meet evolving business demands.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;Workflow Optimization &amp;amp; Analysis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;: Evaluate business processes, gather user requirements, and translate operational needs into technical solutions within the application or migration to alternative solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
