&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;Training &amp;amp; Documentation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;: Create clear user guides, document technical system configurations, and deliver onboarding or continuous training to end-users&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
