&lt;li&gt;Experience maintaining, modifying, and testing experimental aircraft&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success as an engineering team leader and experience balancing cost, schedule, and technical performance considerations when making decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience recruiting and hiring engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting defense contracts and working on classified programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to interact with customers and/or external stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success applying analytical and critical thinking skills to solve multi-disciplinary, open-ended technical problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Systems Engineering fundamentals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently in a dynamic environment to achieve business goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with relevant components of the FAR (e.g. Part 21, Part 25)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;US Citizen with the ability to obtain a DOD security clearance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
