&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MS Office (Word, Excel, Outlook)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience integrating air-launched stores onto launch platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with common military store carriage devices and bomb racks (e.g. MAU-12)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in MIL-STD and MIL-HDBK documents pertinent to store certification and store integration (e.g. MIL-STD-1760, MIL-STD-1553, MIL-HDBK-1763) and experience with store certification efforts and authorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in matrixed organizations supporting multiple programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success as a Chief Engineer overseeing development programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience and expertise in hypersonic flight vehicle design, development, and test&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active DOD security clearance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
