&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain new methods of data ingestion as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve flight test data quality issues. Determine root cause and corrective action to prevent future occurrences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development and maintenance of software tools as required, including configuration management, simulation, deployment, and analysis tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Determine, document, and manage subsystem requirements for each new configuration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and support instrumentation, network, &amp;amp; telemetry tests as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support integration testing such as power checks, sensor calibration, and equipment checkout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with design engineers, network engineers, and technicians as required to accomplish goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare data system material to present at design reviews and flight readiness reviews and in post operation reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate honesty, responsibility, integrity, and fulfillment of commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
