&lt;li&gt;Guidance algorithm synthesis, implementation, and analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Control, autopilot design and analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigation algorithm synthesis, implementation, and analysis&lt;/li&gt;
