&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting MES implementation, configuration, or user support in a manufacturing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with lean manufacturing, process mapping, and continuous improvement methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience generating and maintaining manufacturing documentation and work instructions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in data analysis and reporting using Excel or similar tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently, prioritize tasks, and adapt to changing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and teamwork skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and producing manufacturing documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work on your own initiative and prioritize tasking to fit within the business goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to quickly adapt to changing priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
