&lt;li&gt;Strong mechanical and metallurgical background.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in blueprint reading and GD&amp;amp;T.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in the use of precision measuring tools such as calipers, micrometers, height gauges, pin gauges and other scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in programming CAD/CAM software, and machining centers is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in running manual machines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capable of manufacturing tight tolerance parts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capable of designing parts and fixtures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to be a team player, and work with engineers and shop personnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to adapt quickly, change schedule in a fast paced environment and work independently without supervision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to plan and execute a sequence of operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practice safe operating procedures with all shop equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
