&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MS Office (Word, Excel, PPT, Outlook)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configuration management systems such as JIRA, GIT, JAMA, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3D CAD experience - CATIA or Solidworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with hypersonic and/or supersonic vehicle development, including a full life cycle of the program&lt;/li&gt;
