&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–5 years of experience in program coordination, project management, or related roles within defense, aerospace, or high-technology companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting large, multi-disciplinary programs or projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to work collaboratively in cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
