&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with program management methodologies and tools (e.g., MS Project, Jira).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to aircraft systems, launch vehicles, or aerospace integration programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project Management Professional (PMP) or similar certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Computer Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in MS Office Suite (Word, Excel, Outlook, PowerPoint).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with project management tools (e.g., MS Project, Jira, or equivalent).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Associate or bachelor’s degree (B.S./B.A.) in Engineering, Business Administration, or a related discipline from an accredited institution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equivalent combination of education and experience may be considered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
