&lt;li&gt;Read &amp;amp; Understand Plumbing and Instrumentation Diagrams (P&amp;amp;IDs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and testing high pressure fluid/gas systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tube fitting &amp;amp; bending, familiar with common industry fittings systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
