&lt;li&gt;Systems assembly (work from blueprints, manuals, or diagrams with minimal guidance)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rocket Systems or Test experience preferred, but not required
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liquid Oxygen (LOX) &amp;amp; Cryogenics handling and systems maintenance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LOX Systems handling and cleaning/Clean Room experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
