&lt;li&gt;Airframe &amp;amp; Powerplant License Preferred, but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Level I ($31.67-$45.92): High school diploma or equivalency certificate and 2-5 years of experience in aircraft maintenance, systems fabrication, installation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Level II ($38.51-$55.85): High school diploma or equivalency certificate and 5-10 years of experience in aircraft maintenance, systems fabrication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
