&lt;li&gt;Fundamental knowledge and understanding of environmental component level tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating launch vehicle or aircraft electrical systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience or knowledge of designing test instrumentation systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience reviewing electrical and mechanical schematics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills to share technical challenges and guidance with test stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work on own initiative and prioritize tasking to fit within business goals and schedule&lt;/li&gt;
