&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with configuration management systems – Jira (preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EDUCATION &amp;amp; EXPERIENCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sr Engr Tech ($38.51-$55.85):&lt;/strong&gt; Strong relevant experience in engineering discipline or 10+ years as technician in relevant discipline, with strong proficiency in CAD and EMI/EMC testing.&lt;/li&gt;
