&lt;li&gt;CNC turning, live-tool turning, Y-axis turning, or mill-turn experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with palletized systems and unattended or lights-out machining.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with probing, tool measurement, tool-life monitoring, and tool-breakage detection.&lt;/li&gt;
