&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain engineering capability roadmaps and lead the realization of those capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Propose and lead Internal Research and Development projects to generate intellectual property and enable future business success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support white papers, proposals, and other front end of the business efforts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage in in mentoring and developing more junior colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support recruiting and hiring activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
